/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:9:参考题目如下：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:10:<reference_puzzle index="1" source="eval" puzzle_id="a395ee82" lines="9-24">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:11:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:12:Stamp translated copies of a monochrome template guided by a singleton pixel layout.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:13:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:14:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:15:- bg = background. A large monochrome shape (template, color T).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:16:- Singleton pixels elsewhere: exactly one is color T (layout origin); the rest share color O (overlap color).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:17:- Singletons sit on a uniform-spacing lattice.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:18:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:19:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:20:- Convert each singleton's offset from the origin into coarse lattice units.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:21:- Place a template copy at each offset, scaled by template height/width.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:22:- The origin's copy is painted O instead of T.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:23:- Any pixel covered by two or more copies is also recolored to O.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:24:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:25:Key insight: The single T-colored singleton identifies both the origin position and the "self" copy, which is uniquely recolored.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:26:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:27:</reference_puzzle>
