/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:31:Composite two pattern tiles into a fourth panel using flood-fill from an indicator pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:32:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:33:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:34:- Four 5×5 panels in one row, border-separated.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:35:- Panel 0: cue pixels = wall boundary (8-connected, edge-to-edge, through center)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:36:           + one 8-isolated indicator pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:37:- Panels 1–2: source patterns. Panel 3: blank (to fill).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:38:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:39:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:40:- Flood-fill (4-conn) from indicator, blocked by wall → inside region.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:41:- Inside → non-bg from panel 1; outside → non-bg from panel 2.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:42:- Wall → panel 1 if non-bg; panel 2 fallback when wall is 4-connected.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:43:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:44:Key insight: The cue panel's isolated indicator and wall partition the tile into inside/outside masks that select between the two source panels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:45:</description>
