/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:85:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:86:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:87:- bg = 6 (magenta). Black-bordered (0) rectangles with gray (5) / orange (7) interiors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:88:- A head sprite (9) sits adjacent to one container edge; a matching destination sprite lies along the movement axis.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:89:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:90:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:91:- Each container translates toward its destination along the head-to-dest axis.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:92:- Steps = min(head-to-dest distance, number of gray interior cells).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:93:- Gray cells become orange from the head-facing side inward, one per step.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:94:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:95:Key insight: Gray cell count caps movement — a container stops short if it runs out of gray cells to charge.
