/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:119:Add red outlines around objects, and mark enclosed holes inside hollow objects.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:120:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:121:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:122:- A mostly uniform background contains one or more 4-connected foreground objects.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:123:- Some objects may enclose 4-connected background holes inside their bbox.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:124:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:125:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:126:- For every foreground component, draw a one-cell 8-neighborhood outline in red (2).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:127:- If a component has enclosed background holes, recolor the component to teal (8).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:128:- Fill those enclosed holes with magenta (6) before drawing the outline.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:129:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:130:Key insight: Holes are treated as part of the object for outlining, while only objects
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:131:that actually enclose holes get the teal/magenta interior recoloring.
