/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:156:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:157:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:158:- bg = background. Each active color marks vertices of an 8-direction aligned outline.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:159:- A start vertex can have adjacent non-bg, different-colored shadow pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:160:- Other colored pixels may be distractors unless they lie on valid drawable edges.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:161:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:162:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:163:- For each color, order its pixels by polar angle around their centroid to form a cycle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:164:- Draw only horizontal, vertical, or 45-degree edges whose interiors are clear.
