/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:190:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:191:Reorder and stack rectangles by proximity to two colored edge lines.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:192:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:193:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:194:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:195:- Two edge lines (h + v) meet at a corner marked by a unique color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:196:- "Blue" line is color 1 if present, else the longer line; other is "red."
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:197:- Solid rectangles in the interior.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:198:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:199:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:200:- Sort rectangles by (distance to blue edge, distance to red edge).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:201:- If the blue edge is vertical, rotate each rectangle 90° CCW.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:202:- Stack top-to-bottom, centered horizontally.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:203:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:204:Key insight: Edge-line colors encode a coordinate system; proximity to each axis determines stacking order and rotation.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:205:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed719905968/1/prompt.md:206:</reference_puzzle>
