  50:     - Each panel has a dominant base color and one minority motif color.
  51: 
  52:     Rule:
  53:     - For every row band, clear each panel to its own base color.
  54:     - Paste the right panel's motif mask into the left panel using the right base color.
  55:     - Paste the left panel's motif mask into the right panel using the left base color.
  56: 
  57:     Key insight:
  58:     - The motif colors themselves are distractors; only each motif's shape mask and the two panel base colors are exchanged.
